                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel Visibility="{variable:Clip9:Collapsed}">
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4" FontWeight="Bold"
                                   Text="1. 带釉陶瓦" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4"
                                   Text="在游戏里，带釉陶瓦由Johan Aronson设计。" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4" FontWeight="Bold"
                                   Text="2. 僵尸" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4"
                                   Text="僵尸穿上盔甲的顺序是按照“头盔—胸甲—护腿—靴子”的顺序来生成的。比如一个生成时穿着护腿的僵尸就一定穿戴了头盔和胸甲。" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4" FontWeight="Bold"
                                   Text="3. 猫" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4"
                                   Text="黑猫的皮肤外观基于孟买猫。其祖先品种是缅甸猫和美国短毛猫。" />
